gText_Birch_Welcome::
	.string "Hello there! Terribly sorry to\n"
	.string "keep you waiting!\p"
	.string "Welcome to the world of POKéMON!\p"
	.string "My name is ALAN.\p"
	.string "But everyone round here calls me\n"
	.string "THE GENTLEMAN.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_Pokemon::
	.string "This is what we call a “POKéMON.”\p"
	.string "\n"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_MainSpeech::
	.string "This world is widely inhabited by\n"
	.string "creatures known as POKéMON.\p"
	.string "We live alongside them: as\n"
	.string "playmates, as workmates, and on a\l"
	.string "good day, as dinner guests.\p"
	.string "And sometimes, we band together\n"
	.string "and battle others like us.\l"
	.string "All very sporting.\p"
	.string "But for all our closeness, we still\n"
	.string "don't know everything about POKéMON.\p"
	.string "So I study them. That, and a good\n"
	.string "plate of pasta, is what I live for.\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AndYouAre::
	.string "And who might you be?$"

gText_Birch_BoyOrGirl::
	.string "Are you a boy?\n"
	.string "Or are you a girl?$"

gText_Birch_WhatsYourName::
	.string "Right then.\n"
	.string "What's your name?$"

gText_Birch_SoItsPlayer::
	.string "So it's {PLAYER}{KUN}?$"

gText_Birch_YourePlayer::
	.string "Ah, of course!\p"
	.string "You're {PLAYER}{KUN}, who's moving to\n"
	.string "my hometown of LIL RAGU.\l"
	.string "Splendid!\p"
	.string "$"

gText_Birch_AreYouReady::
	.string "Right, are you ready?\p"
	.string "Your very own adventure is about\n"
	.string "to unfold.\p"
	.string "Be brave, and leap into a world of\n"
	.string "POKéMON, friendship, adventure…\l"
	.string "and the finest pasta in the land!\p"
	.string "I'll be expecting you later.\n"
	.string "Do pop by my POKéMON LAB.\p"
	.string "$"
